{"availability":"available","full":"ag2ai/ag2","name":"ag2","description":"AG2 (formerly AutoGen): The Open-Source AgentOS.Join us at: https://discord.gg/sNGSwQME3x","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":4978,"forks":737,"created":"2024-11-11T20:43:34Z","updated":"2026-10-06T04:40:13Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ag2.ai","topics":["a2a","ag2","agent-framework","agentic","agentic-ai","ai","ai-agents-framework","aiagents","genai","llm","llms","mcp","multi-agent","multi-agent-system","open-source","python"],"demo":"https://playground.ag2.ai/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:43:10.122Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:43:10.122Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:43:10.122Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:32.106Z","stars":4974,"forks":735},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:53.769Z","stars":4975,"forks":735},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:43:10.122Z","stars":4978,"forks":737}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AG2 is an open-source programming framework for building AI agents and facilitating cooperation among multiple agents to solve tasks. AG2 aims to streamline the development and research of agentic AI. It offers features such as agents capable of interacting with each other, facilitates the use of various large language models (LLMs) and tool use support, autonomous and human-in-the-loop workflows, and multi-agent conversation patterns.","The project is currently maintained by a dynamic group of volunteers from several organizations. Contact project administrators Chi Wang and Qingyun Wu via support@ag2.ai if you are interested in becoming a maintainer.","We have several agent concepts in AG2 to help you build your AI agents. We introduce the most common ones here."],"features":["Agents: Agent is the core building block — it talks to a model provider, calls tools, and returns a reply.","Tools: Plain Python functions, decorated with @tool, that the agent can invoke.","Human in the loop: Pause a run to collect confirmation or missing information from a person.","Orchestrating multiple agents: Coordinate several agents over a hub and typed channels using the Network.","The agent harness: Opt-in primitives layered onto an agent — persistent knowledge, context assembly, and history compaction."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ag2ai/ag2/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"aea3e0bd0776beee2acaa1dd04db04e1e07491164dcb76664f108d5bb22a83c2","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:32.282Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:54.275Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"AG2 is an open-source programming framework for building AI agents and facilitating cooperation among multiple agents to solve tasks. AG2 aims to streamline the development and research of agentic AI. It offers features such as agents capable of interacting with each other, facilitates the use of various large language models (LLMs) and tool use support, autonomous and human-in-the-loop workflows, and multi-agent conversation patterns.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ag2ai/ag2/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"aea3e0bd0776beee2acaa1dd04db04e1e07491164dcb76664f108d5bb22a83c2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ag2ai/ag2/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:54.276Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T04:40:13Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ag2ai/ag2/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:54.277Z","hash":"aea3e0bd0776beee2acaa1dd04db04e1e07491164dcb76664f108d5bb22a83c2","originalBytes":20189,"storedBytes":20189,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["ag2","agent","import","await","agents","config","classic","model","def","main","openaiconfig","reply","async","code","prompt","hub","knowledge","install","license","none","plan","print","python","run","conversation","lesson","tool","gpt-4o-mini","reply.body","return","reviewer","store","turn","api","autoge